            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EThis is the hint. The data is coming from the controller, and could be from an external data source.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHints for fields are left aligned by default.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\u0022text-align: center;\u0022\u003EHints can be centered.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\u0022text-align: right;\u0022\u003EHints can be right aligned.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\u0022text-align: left;\u0022 class=\u0022custom-class\u0022\u003EHints can have custom classes applied.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
